      "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Our simplified approach.&nbsp;<br>\n <span class=\"futura-bold\">Your goals in mind.</span></span></h2>\n<p><b><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Stryker is proud to participate in the Vizient Connections Summit, bringing together solutions that help healthcare organizations drive operational efficiency and support strategic priorities.</span></b></p>\n",
